OL,3,GNEWSAItems stolen from Man Utd Munich
OL,4,Aair disaster memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA glass sculpture and medals have been
OL,7,Fstolen from a memorial to the 23 people
OL,8,Fkilled in the Munich air disaster,
OL,9,Fincluding eight Manchester United
OL,10,Fplayers.
OL,12,FThe items were taken from a display
OL,13,Fcase at Manchesterplatz in Munich,
OL,14,Fwhere the plane crashed on take-off on
OL,15,F6 February 1958 after refuelling on its
OL,16,Freturn from a European Cup match in
OL,17,FBelgrade.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40902
SC,0002
