PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1793373981
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAItems stolen from Man Utd Munich
OL,4,Aair disaster memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FMunich Police said the glass case
OL,7,Faround the memorial was smashed with a
OL,8,Frock when the items were taken between
OL,9,F08:00 and 13:00 local time on Monday 26
OL,10,FOctober.
OL,12,FThe Manchester Munich Memorial
OL,13,FFoundation (MMMF) said it was "deeply
OL,14,Fsaddened", while its chair, Ifty Ahmed,
OL,15,Fsaid the theft had caused emotional
OL,16,Fharm to families.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
